@startuml
title US0010 - "As a User, I want to register a new publication in the system" - SD

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox
autonumber

' --- Actor and participants ---
actor User
participant ":RegisterPublicationUI" as UI
participant ":RegisterNew%n()PublicationController" as Ctl
participant ":MemoPublicationRepo" as PR
participant ":PublicationFactory" as PF

' --- UI interaction ---
User -> UI: I want to register %n()a new publication
activate UI
UI --> User: Fill in the publication's %n()information
deactivate UI

User -> UI: publicationType, %n()identifier, %n()publicationYear, %n()title, author, %n()publisher, edition, %n()genre
activate UI

' --- Use case execution ---
UI -> Ctl: registerPublication(%n()publicationType, %n()identifier, %n()publicationYear, %n()title, author, publisher, %n()edition, genre)
activate Ctl
Ctl -> PR: addPublication(%n()publicationType, %n()identifier, %n()publicationYear, %n()title, author, publisher, %n()edition, genre)
activate PR

' --- Creation  ---
PR -> PF: createPublication(%n()publicationType, %n()identifier, %n()publicationYear, %n()title, author, publisher, %n()edition, genre)
activate PF
create "newPublication:Publication"
PF -->> "newPublication:Publication": <<create>>
PF --> PR: newPublication
deactivate PF

' --- Duplication check ---
PR -> PR : contains(%n()newPublication)

note right PR: assuming happy path %n()where the above returns %n()**false**


' --- Storage ---
PR -> PR: add(newPublication)
PR --> Ctl: newPublication
deactivate PR
Ctl --> UI: newPublication
deactivate Ctl

UI --> User: You have %n()successfully %n()registered a %n()new publication.
deactivate UI
@enduml
